email.body:
Dear {giver},

Just like last year, each of us is bringing a present on Christmas Eve for the person we drew.

The draw is a secret – only you know who you're preparing a present for, and they won't know it's from you. If there's something you'd love to receive, you can add it to your wishlist as a hint for the person who drew you. To find out who your present is for this year, click the button below.

{button}

It looks like we'll all be spending Christmas in {location}, but if someone can't make it, the present can be sent by post.

{budget_line}

In total, {guest_count|1:# person is|# people are} taking part this year.

Merry Christmas!

PS If the button doesn't work, open this link: {url}

